        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>2 Foot Contemporary Stainless Steel Glass Door Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 24\" industrial style stainless steel glass door handles feature clean mitered ends with a nice easy to grip 1-1/4\" diameter round pull handle that is very comfortable.  For use on glass shower doors and commercial glass doors such as store entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-25S-specifications.gif?v=1704354508\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SD409-610 2 Foot Contemporary Stainless Steel Glass Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>14\" Glass Door Handles</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/3-foot-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>36\" Glass Door Handles</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/4-foot-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>48\" Glass Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  2 Foot Contemporary Glass Door Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 22-3/4\" (578 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/8\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 door handles and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 3/4\" thick glass doors. For use with 1/2\" or 5/8\" diameter hole in glass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pull Handles)</b>\r\n</p>",
